OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bans people from meetings
OL,4,Aafter disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council that has faced three
OL,7,Fyears of disruption at meetings has
OL,8,Fissued banning orders to members of the
OL,9,Fpublic.
OL,11,FThetford Town Council said it was
OL,12,Ftaking the measure to exclude four
OL,13,Fpeople from future meetings.
OL,15,FOn 28 July, police and security guards
OL,16,Fwere called to remove people accused of
OL,17,Facting in what the council described as
OL,18,Fan "aggressive and intimidating" way.
OL,20,FOne councillor told the BBC a group
OL,21,Fwere "driving people with genuine
OL,22,Fquestions away".
